                <div style="margin:.9rem 0;padding:.8rem;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:.6rem;"><small style="color:#64748b;">Correo institucional generado</small><div style="font-weight:600;color:#233147;" x-text="previewEmail()"></div><small>Si ya existe, se agregará un consecutivo.</small></div>
                <label style="display:block;margin-bottom:.9rem;">Rol<select name="rol" required style="display:block;width:100%;margin-top:.3rem;padding:.65rem;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:.5rem;"><option value="capturista">Capturista</option><option value="agente">Agente</option><option value="admin">Admin</option></select></label>
